  "bodyHash": "5co30+Hgo3Y=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/gZDWWY6.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1270\" height=\"70\"></p><h2><strong>Fusion</strong></h2><h5>Fusion 是一個同時支援 Forge 和 Fabric 的函式庫，為資源包和其他模組新增了連結紋理、自訂實體模型等進階資源包功能！</h5><h5>可以選擇性地與 Fusion 整合，實現軟性依賴。</h5><h2>📖 <strong>Wiki</strong></h2><h4><strong>針對資源包開發者：</strong><br><a href=\"https://github.com/SuperMartijn642/Fusion/wiki#for-resource-packs\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/SuperMartijn642/Fusion/wiki#for-resource-packs</a><br><strong>針對模組開發者：</strong><br><a href=\"https://github.com/SuperMartijn642/Fusion/wiki#for-resource-packs\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/SuperMartijn642/Fusion/wiki#for-mod-developers</a></h4><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/gZDWWY6.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1270\" height=\"70\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>資源包</strong></h2><p>以下是支援 Fusion 的資源包清單。</p><h5>官方資源包：</h5><ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1377/882/256/256/638893928404416388.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fusion-block-transitions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fusion 方塊過渡</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1377/890/638893930557723430.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fusion-connected-blocks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fusion 連結方塊</a><br></strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1375/51/256/256/638892394958741232.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fusion-connected-glass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fusion 連結玻璃</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1375/52/638892394985747262.webp\" alt=\"Fusion 發光礦石\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fusion-emissive-ores\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fusion 發光礦石</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1375/53/638892395010880381.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fusion-stacking-items\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fusion 堆疊物品</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1375/54/638892395038737978.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fusion-3d-items\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fusion 3D 物品</a></strong></li>\n</ul><h5>第三方資源包：</h5><ul>\n<li><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1727/284/64/64/639098995529432625_animated.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\">&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/connected-bricks-fusion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">連結磚塊（Fusion）</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1727/275/64/64/639098988878948195_animated.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/connected-paths-fusion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">連結路徑（Fusion）</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1727/282/64/64/639098993521023325_animated.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/connected-rocks-fusion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">連結岩石（Fusion）</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1704/271/64/64/639082583739241797.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/deep-origins-overlays\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">深淵起源疊層</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1223/138/64/64/638801460024569510.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/glowing-emissive-ores-fusion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">發光發光礦石 - Fusion</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1163/114/64/64/638732488516403817.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mt-bgs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Midnighttigger 的更好草地</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/910/56/64/64/638363589148143270.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mt-ct-d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Midnighttigger 的預設連結紋理</a><br></strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/906/996/64/64/638357604967566677.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mt-ct-d-a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Midnighttigger 的預設連結紋理擴充</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1298/7/64/64/638843737614967018.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/snow-side-texture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">雪側紋理</a></strong></li>\n</ul><p><em>（此清單並非完整列出。如果您製作了與 Fusion 相容的資源包並希望列於此處，請在 Discord 上傳送訊息給我。）</em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/gZDWWY6.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1270\" height=\"70\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>連結紋理</strong></h2><h4>連結紋理是具有特殊排列方式的紋理，可與連結模型類型搭配使用，讓方塊之間產生連結效果。Fusion 提供 7 種不同的連結紋理排列方式，適用於各種情境。</h4><h4>以下是完整版和緊湊版的範例：</h4><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/AoSdjrP.gif\" alt=\"邊框木紋磚範例\" width=\"380\" height=\"280\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/AJ9kVP5.gif\" alt=\"鋼樑範例\" width=\"440\" height=\"281\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/gZDWWY6.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1270\" height=\"70\"></strong></h4><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>捲動紋理</strong></h2><h4>捲動紋理是一種動態紋理，會在圖片上進行捲動。捲動可發生在紋理的任意角落之間，甚至斜向移動！<br>以下是輸送帶的範例：</h4><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/CUJoRk7.png\" alt=\"捲動紋理輸送帶範例\" width=\"300\" height=\"230\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/uFCxMjF.gif\" alt=\"捲動紋理輸送帶\" width=\"400\" height=\"554\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/gZDWWY6.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1270\" height=\"70\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>連續紋理</strong></h2><h4>連續紋理可讓您建立跨越多個方塊的紋理！</h4><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1060/610/large-stone-bricks.png\" alt=\"大型石磚範例\" width=\"400\" height=\"215\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/gZDWWY6.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1270\" height=\"70\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>📐 方塊疊層</strong></h2><h4>利用連結模型和連結紋理類型提供的功能，您還可以實現方塊疊層效果！</h4><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/I6Whhhe.gif\" alt=\"沙子覆蓋範例\" width=\"470\" height=\"264\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1060/609/grass-overflow.png\" alt=\"草地覆蓋範例\" width=\"355\" height=\"266\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/gZDWWY6.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1270\" height=\"70\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>自訂實體模型</h2><h4>自訂實體模型和實體模型修改器可讓資源包根據高度、生態域、維度、年齡等各種條件，隨機變更實體模型和紋理。</h4><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1060/606/rooster.png\" alt=\"自訂雞模型\" width=\"420\" height=\"272\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1060/612/snowy-cow.png\" alt=\"針葉林牛變種\" width=\"400\" height=\"273\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/gZDWWY6.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1270\" height=\"70\">&nbsp;</p><h2>常見問題</h2><p><strong>我可以在我的模組包中使用你的模組嗎？</strong><br>可以，您可以在模組包中使用 Fusion<br><strong>我需要在伺服器上安裝 Fusion 嗎？</strong><br>不需要，Fusion 僅需安裝在用戶端，安裝在伺服器上不會產生任何作用<br><strong>為什麼 Fusion 與 Sodium 不相容？<br></strong>如果您使用的 Sodium 版本低於 0.6，則還需要安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/indium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Indium</a>。Sodium 會取代原版渲染，忽略 Fabric 渲染 API。Indium 會修補 Sodium 以支援 Fabric 渲染 API</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
